# The pictures of datums.md: a block's top face named top on the
# datums screen; then a model linking a tile twice, and the tiles'
# tops mated flush by name.
size tw 760 600
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
twmove 505 128
twdown L 505 128
twup L 505 128
twmove 510 128
twdown L 510 128
twup L 510 128
edit 10
click-face top face of g003-extrude
menu Edit|Datums...
cursor on
twmove 120 133
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
mark 30 122 245 22 tw
shot datums-1-name-link
twdown L 120 133
twup L 120 133
edit top
cursor off
shot datums-2-named
# A model that links a tile twice, the tiles' tops mated by name.
answer no
file $testdata/datums/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/datums/tile.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/datums/tile.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
menu Edit|Datums...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
# The second tile dragged up and aside by a corner.
move 421 77
down L 421 77
move 430 72 L
move 450 55 L
move 480 35 L
up L 480 35
key esc
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu Edit|Datums...
cursor off
shot datums-3-linked
twmove 361 183
twdown L 361 183
twup L 361 183
twmove 361 253
twdown L 361 253
twup L 361 253
cursor on
twmove 60 323
mark 30 312 70 22 tw
shot datums-4-mate-names tw
twdown L 60 323
twup L 60 323
cursor off
shot datums-5-flush
